@HeimdallGateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:6004

### Start OIDC login (open this request in a browser)
GET {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/account/login

### Anonymous student endpoint. The gateway creates bifrost-anonymous-user on the first call.
POST {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/api/students/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "anonymous-student",
  "message": "Student message with automatic anonymous cookie"
}

### Anonymous student request endpoint. The same cookie is reused by the client.
POST {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/api/students/createrequest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "request-1",
  "userId": "anonymous-student",
  "message": "Create a request as an anonymous student"
}

### Teacher endpoint without login. Expected: 302 redirect to VarService OIDC login.
POST {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "teacher-unauthenticated",
  "message": "This should require OIDC authentication"
}

### Teacher endpoint after completing OIDC login as Knud.
POST {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "knud",
  "message": "Teacher request authenticated as Knud"
}

### Teacher endpoint after completing OIDC login as Bob.
POST {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/api/teachers/sendmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "bob",
  "message": "Teacher request authenticated as Bob"
}

### Logout
GET {{HeimdallGateway_HostAddress}}/account/logout
